      "description": "List the user's Sequences\n\nPages through the user's Sequences, newest first, each\nwith its title and length; sequence-get reads one in full, with its song,\nshots, characters and sets. `query` keeps the ones whose title holds it. A page reads\nat most 20, so a filtered page can be short, or empty, and still have a\n`cursor`: pass it back to look further. Only for a suno.com user whose token\ngrants `visuals`; anyone else gets 404.",
